     * revision moves whenever the draft is saved with changes, published or discarded, the avatar is
     * uploaded, or the live agent is changed in a way the editor shows. revision_updated_by is null
     * when the change came from an API key or the system.
     *
     * Scopes: automation:read.
     *
     *
     * @throws ApiException
     *
     * @see https://api.sendseven.com/api/v1/docs#/AI%20Agents/get_agent_draft_revision_api_v1_automation_agents__agent_id__draft_revision_get
