    /**
     * Test Agent.
     *
     * Run one test-console turn. Nothing is sent to a customer (credits reports what a live turn would
     * bill). The turn is recorded in the audit log with surface test. Rate limited to 20 turns per
     * minute and 200 per hour per workspace (429 + Retry-After).
     *
     * Paid accounts: the first 500 test turns per billing account and UTC day are free. Further test
     * turns still run but are charged by usage in AI credits like a live reply (usage_billed is true
     * on those responses).
     *
     * During a free trial (account without a paid subscription) each test turn uses the trial AI
     * credits it would cost in a live conversation; when they are used up the call returns 403
     * trial_ai_credits_exhausted without running the agent (503 trial_ai_credits_unavailable when the
     * trial state cannot be checked). Trials also have an hourly / daily test-turn cap per account
     * (429).
     *
     * Scopes: automation:update.
     *
     * @param  list<array<string, mixed>>|null  $history
     * @param  array<string, mixed>|null  $state
     * @param  array<string, mixed>|null  $task
     * @param  list<string>|null  $attachmentIds
